# sdist 只包含运行 pip 包所需的内容：Python 包 + 构建/说明文件。
# 其余目录（tests/ lab/ bench/ examples/ docs/ tools/ src/ cuda/ shaders/ 等）
# 是仓库侧的开发/构建资源，不随 PyPI sdist 分发（wheel 只含 python/tgai_go）。
prune *
graft python/tgai_go
include README.md
include CHANGELOG.md
include LICENSE
include PLUGINS.md
include pyproject.toml
